    <description><![CDATA[
# AdapterGit (Lite Edition)

Pure-Rust Git implementation — portable single binary.
Zero external Git dependencies, never hangs, AI-safe.

**Lite edition** is a single-file download-and-run binary:
- No TLS (local operations only)
- No AI features
- Minimal size (~5MB)

Ideal for CI/CD, Docker, USB drives, and temporary environments.
    ]]></description>
